<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>404 - Page Not Found</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f5f1ed;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .container {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 600px;
        }

        .card {
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 16px;
            border: 1px solid #e8e4df;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
            padding: 80px 60px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .error-code {
            font-size: 120px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #6b5347;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            letter-spacing: -2px;
            line-height: 1;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 32px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #3d2e28;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }

        p {
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #8b7e74;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            max-width: 400px;
            margin-left: auto;
            margin-right: auto;
        }

        .btn-home {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 16px 48px;
            background-color: #6b5347;
            color: #ffffff;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 500;
            transition: background-color 0.3s, transform 0.2s;
            border: none;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .btn-home:hover {
            background-color: #5a4a42;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        .btn-home:active {
            transform: translateY(0);
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .card {
                padding: 60px 40px;
            }

            .error-code {
                font-size: 90px;
            }

            h1 {
                font-size: 26px;
            }

            p {
                font-size: 15px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="card">
            <div class="error-code">404</div>
            <h1>Page Not Found</h1>
            <p>We're sorry, but the page you're looking for doesn't exist or has been moved. Let's get you back on track.</p>
            <a href="/" class="btn-home">Return to Homepage</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>